      "slug": "knn-classify",
      "lesson_source_path": "Day81-90/82.k最近邻算法.md",
      "title": "kNN 最近邻分类",
      "difficulty": "hard",
      "tags": ["knn", "distance", "classification", "sorting"],
      "prompt": "实现 `knn_predict(train_points, labels, query, k)`，使用 k 最近邻算法预测一个样本的字符串标签。\n\n使用欧氏距离的平方排序（无需开平方）；距离相同时，训练样本中位置靠前的点优先进入前 `k` 个邻居。得票数相同时，选择这些邻居中该标签距离总和更小的标签；若仍相同，选择字典序更小的标签。\n\n输入保证训练点非空、维度一致、标签数量匹配，且 `1 <= k <= len(train_points)`。不得导入机器学习或数值计算包。",
      "function_name": "knn_predict",
      "signature": {
        "parameters": [
          {"name": "train_points", "type": "list[list[float]]"},
          {"name": "labels", "type": "list[str]"},
          {"name": "query", "type": "list[float]"},
          {"name": "k", "type": "int"}
        ],
        "returns": "str"
      },
      "starter_code": "def knn_predict(train_points: list[list[float]], labels: list[str], query: list[float], k: int) -> str:\n    return \"\"\n",
      "cases": [
        {
          "args": [
            [[0, 0], [1, 1], [5, 5], [6, 6]],
            ["A", "A", "B", "B"],
            [1, 0],
            3
          ],
          "expected": "A",
          "explanation": "三个最近邻中 A 获得两票。"
        },
        {
          "args": [
            [[0], [10], [4], [6]],
            ["red", "red", "blue", "blue"],
            [5],
            4
          ],
          "expected": "blue",
          "explanation": "票数相等时，blue 邻居的距离总和更小。"
        },
        {
          "args": [
            [[0], [2]],
            ["beta", "alpha"],
            [1],
            2
          ],
          "expected": "alpha",
          "explanation": "票数和距离均相同，使用标签字典序打破平局。"
        },
        {
          "args": [
            [[-3, -3], [2, 2], [9, 9]],
            ["left", "middle", "right"],
            [1, 2],
            1
          ],
          "expected": "middle",
          "explanation": "k 为 1 时直接选择最近样本的标签。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "slug": "gini-impurity",
      "lesson_source_path": "Day81-90/83.决策树和随机森林.md",
      "title": "计算基尼不纯度",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "tags": ["decision-tree", "classification", "statistics"],
      "prompt": "实现 `gini_impurity(labels)`，计算一个分类节点的基尼不纯度：`1 - sum(p_i ** 2)`，其中 `p_i` 是每个标签在节点中的比例。\n\n标签是字符串。空节点和只含一种标签的节点都返回 `0.0`。结果直接返回浮点数，不要自行格式化或舍入；样例使用近似比较处理浮点误差。",
      "function_name": "gini_impurity",
      "signature": {
        "parameters": [
          {"name": "labels", "type": "list[str]"}
        ],
        "returns": "float"
      },
      "starter_code": "def gini_impurity(labels: list[str]) -> float:\n    return 0.0\n",
      "cases": [
        {
          "args": [[]],
          "expected": 0.0,
          "explanation": "空节点没有类别不确定性。",
          "comparison": "approximate",
          "tolerance": 1e-09
        },
        {
          "args": [["cat"]],
          "expected": 0.0,
          "explanation": "纯节点的不纯度为零。",
          "comparison": "approximate",
          "tolerance": 1e-09
        },
        {
          "args": [["a", "a", "b", "b"]],
          "expected": 0.5,
          "explanation": "两个类别各占一半时结果为 0.5。",
          "comparison": "approximate",
          "tolerance": 1e-09
        },
        {
          "args": [["a", "a", "b"]],
          "expected": 0.4444444444444444,
          "explanation": "类别比例为 2/3 与 1/3。",
          "comparison": "approximate",
          "tolerance": 1e-09
        }
      ]
    },
    {
